{"nodes": [{"id": "supabase_tests_audit_trail_test_audit_trail_test", "label": "audit_trail_test (card ^ref-09)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "supabase/tests/audit_trail_test.sql", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Failure-case suite for v_audit_trail, the OW 11 reader. TC-A/TC-B: an L3 and an L2 session each read 0 rows (role gate in the database, not the nav, ADR-004). TC-C: the Owner still reads rows, so 'deny everyone' cannot pass the deny tests vacuously. TC-D: a one-field UPDATE expands to exactly one row with field_name/old_value/new_value correct and actor_name joined from profiles. TC-E: an INSERT is one event with a null field_name, not one row per column. TC-F: an authenticated session is refused a direct read of audit_log, can still select the view, and no anon/authenticated grant was added on the table. TC-G: changed_at is audit_log.created_at, not the audited row's created_at and not the business event_date (ADR-007). Covers failure cases, not only the happy path."}], "edges": [{"source": "supabase_tests_audit_trail_test_audit_trail_test", "target": "supabase_views_040_v_audit_trail_v_audit_trail", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "supabase/tests/audit_trail_test.sql", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "supabase_tests_audit_trail_test_audit_trail_test", "target": "supabase_migrations_20260908000002_identity_config_audit_log", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "supabase/tests/audit_trail_test.sql", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "supabase_tests_audit_trail_test_audit_trail_test", "target": "supabase_migrations_20260908000003_purchasing_production_purchase_orders", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "supabase/tests/audit_trail_test.sql", "source_locatio